          <span class="room-facts"><span>Fino a 4 ospiti</span><span>King × 1</span><span>Sofa Bed × 1</span></span><span class="amenities" aria-label="Servizi in camera"><span>Wi-Fi</span><span>Minibar</span><span>Balcone</span></span>
